>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `ORDER_ext_ss`

``` hol4
orderLib.ORDER_ext_ss : simpExtLib.ssfrag
orderLib.ORDER_ext_ss_budgeted :
  searchBudget.budget -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides the explicitly tracked order-decision fragment.

The extension fragments lift the same ordinary reducer closures used by
`ORDER_ss` and `ORDER_ss_budgeted`, retaining their context collection
and budget ownership. Select this fragment before installing it in an
extension simpset. Ordinary standalone order fragments and their clients
remain ordinary.

### Example

``` hol4
val order_ss = simpExtLib.++
  (simpExtLib.lift_simpset (BasicProvers.srw_ss ()), orderLib.ORDER_ext_ss);
```

### See also

[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss)
